Well, I dunno if the following have been mentioned before, 
but maybe this would be nice as a guide for new shoplifters
in 3.1 (spoilers follow) 
 
1) With the abundance of scrolls/wands of create monster and
   wands of digging nowadays - it's quite convenient :
   (a) close and lock the door
   (b) pick up all the stuff u want and go stand at a corner
   (c) create several monsters to fill the room - enuff to
       form a good blockade betwn u and the shopkeeper
   (d) zap wand of digging down

2) With the abundance of wands of teleport - zap the shopkeeper
   instead of urself and then dig the floor. Works better cos u
   dun need to grope ur way down thru the kop waves. On ur way
   back from hell - man - the shopkeeper should easily be in
   smithereens in 3 rds. 8)

3) This is a riskier one - paralyse the dude with a blessed potion
   of paralysis. Kinda dangerous.

